  Name: D12 Postcard
  Text: "Dear Hr\xF6nn\r\nToday is that day! I set off on my grand adventure! Haha
    well\u2026 maybe other people might call it tourism but it sounds less fancy
    when you put it like that. I will try to write often and I won't forget to bring
    you back some souvenirs. \r\nYours,\r\nTerra"
